      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can you confirm that this happens without using the seated mode toggle? In my testing so far the only thing I've noticed is the properly working feature of popping the user out of seated mode into standing mode (and thus removing any vertical offset that was applied to align the HMD in the playspace with a standing height of the avatar in the VR world)\n\nI tested on avtr_2f9f22cf-6a2e-4e3a-b43b-7dff30ee3aac and didn't find any difference in behavior between live and open beta.\n\nIf this doesn't occur when only in standing mode, it's likely the feature to cancel seated mode when the user moves a lot vertically.",
