  "details": "When playspacing upwards or downwards, or clicking seated mode, my avatar's height and viewport resets itself without prompt or input.\n\nObservations:\n\n1.) This bug began to occur when 1431 dropped; doesn't happen on Live.\n\n2.) Happens regardless if OVR Advanced Settings is open or not.\n\n3.) GoGoLoco is not involved.\n\n4.) Affects sit/stand mode.\n\n5.) Happens in VR mode.\n\nI suspect that it may have to do with activating Horizon Adjust mode.\n\nDiscord embed: https://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/449386885299830794/1218775016393543802\n\nVideo file: https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/449386885299830794/1218775013612851300/1431_playspace_bug.mp4",
